    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in introducing this wonderful four-bedroom three-bathroom semi-detached family home tucked away on a peaceful cul de sac in the picturesque and highly sought-after development of Sallins Wharf, Co Kildare.\r\n\r\nThe location will not be beaten as you are in the heart of Sallins village and a short drive into Naas town centre, on your doorstep you will find a range of local bars, shops, schools and leisure facilities with plenty of transport links such as Sallins Train Station. Commuting is made easy with the Sallins bypass with direct access onto the M7/N7 motorways and with it only being a short 20-minute drive into Dublin it is one of your best commuter towns. \r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 149 sqm comprises of entrance hallway with guest bathroom, large living room to front with open fireplace and bay window, second living room, fully fitted kitchen, dining room and separate utility room. On the first floor you have four generous bedrooms with built in wardrobes (one master ensuite) and main family bathroom. Then comes the real showpiece of the house, an extra-large rear garden that has so much scope and potential for further development, its private & fully enclosed with the use of a shed that is great for additional storage, it also has a pergola area that makes it perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings. The front here offers off-street parking on a peaceful cul de sac with minimal passing traffic. \r\n\r\nNumber 20 Sallins Wharf is presented in great condition throughout having been lovingly maintained by its current owners with no expense spared when upgrading in recent years and benefits from generous sized rooms, gas fired central, top quality fixtures & fittings and well-maintained extra-large rear garden. This one is sure to cause a stir with a wide range of buyers and is absolutely ideal for any first-time buyer looking to get on the property ladder or any growing family looking to settle roots in a highly sought-after development. \r\n\r\nCall Ray Cooke Auctioneers today for further information or to arrange a viewing. \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- BER C2\r\n- c. 149 sqm \r\n- Semi-detached family home\r\n- 4 bed / 3 bath \r\n- Extra-large rear garden\r\n- Plenty of scope for further development \r\n- Shed to the rear for storage \r\n- Very well-maintained rear garden \r\n- Private & fully enclosed \r\n- Mature garden\r\n- Stunning condition throughout \r\n- Tastefully decorated from top to bottom \r\n- Extra spacious rooms\r\n- Entrance hallway\r\n- Guest bathroom \r\n- Large living room with fireplace & bay window\r\n- Second living room \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen\r\n- Dining room \r\n- Separate utility room \r\n- Four generous bedrooms \r\n- Built in wardrobes \r\n- Master ensuite fully tiled \r\n- Main family bathroom \r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Energy efficient gas boiler \r\n- Double glazed windows \r\n- Top quality blinds \r\n- Top quality flooring \r\n- Solid flooring downstairs \r\n- Located on peaceful cul de sac \r\n- Off-street parking \r\n- Close to large green area \r\n- Highly sought-after development \r\n- Fantastic transport routes \r\n- In the heart of Sallins village \r\n- Convent location with easy access to Naas and the N7 \r\n- Prime for first time buyers \r\n- Call today to register your interest \r\n\r\nDirections - W91W967"
      },
      {
